ndex KSU Home Faculty Affairs Academic Affairs Faculty Affairs Faculty Affairs Faculty Affairs Home Faculty Openings Hiring Policies & Guidelines New Faculty Information Faculty Evaluation & Review Faculty Resource Guide Faculty Affairs Forms Contact Faculty Affairs Academic Affairs Office of Faculty Affairs The Office of Faculty Affairs is primarily responsible for managing policies and procedures\n                     related to faculty, overseeing faculty searches and hiring, handling faculty leaves,\n                     and coordinating faculty evaluations and reviews related to tenure, promotion and\n                     post-tenure review. This office also helps coordinate faculty development activities\n                     among several different units. Faculty records are maintained in the Office of Faculty\n                     Affairs in order to ensure compliance with various regulatory agencies. Quick Resources OneUSG Connect Login Faculty Resource Guide Watermark Login Campus Systems and Access Contact Information Kennesaw Campus 1000 Chastain Road Kennesaw, GA 30144 Marietta Campus 1100 South Marietta Pkwy Marietta, GA 30060 Phone 470-KSU-INFO (470-578-4636) Campus Maps Parking Media Resources Campus A-Z Index Academic Calendar Campus News D2L Brightspace University Information Technology Services Related Links Libraries Housing Financial Aid Degrees, Majors & Programs Registrar Job Opportunities Campus Security Global Education Sustainability Accessibility © 2026 Kennesaw State University. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Statement Accreditation Advisories Report a Concern Feedback Open Records Human Trafficking Notice Text Only ©"
