      "title": "Annual Review, Promotion & Tenure",
      "description": "Annual Review, Promotion & Tenure - Academic Affairs Skip to main navigation Skip to main content Skip to footer KSU Home Current Students MyKSU Resources D2L Brightspace Owl Express KSUmail DegreeWorks KCash Owl Life Handshake Course Evaluations Campus Services Dining Parking & Transportation University Libraries Student Health Services Service Portal Student Employment Campus Directory Academic Resources Tutoring Resources Student Success Advising Student Handbook Bursar Financial Aid University Registrar Faculty & Staff MyKSU Resources D2L Brightspace Owl Express/Banner KSUmail KSU Connect VPN Academic Resources Academic Affairs Faculty Affairs Center for Excellence in Teaching and Learning Course Evaluations Open Education Resources Faculty Handbook Promotion & Tenure University Registrar Employee Resources Service Portal Human Resources Campus Services University Information Technology Services Campus Directory Payroll OneUSG Connect Colleges Colleges Coles College of Business Geer College of the Arts College of Architecture & Construction Management Bagwell College of Education College of Computing & Software Engineering Norman J. Radow College of Humanities & Social Sciences College of Science & Mathematics Graduate College KSU Journey Honors College Southern Polytechnic College of Engineering & Engineering Technology Wellstar College of Health & Human Services Offices & Services Offices & Services University Registrar Parking & Transportation Student Affairs Housing & Residence Life Event & Venue Management University Information Technology Services Fiscal Services University Libraries Academic Advising Campus Operations Strategic Communications & Marketing Policies & Governance Policy Resources University Handbooks Institutional Policies Complaints & Appeals Conflict of Interest General Data Protection Regulation Protecting Minors Public Forum FERPA Governance University Council Administrators Council Staff Senate Faculty Senate Student Government A-Z Index KSU Home Annual Review, Promotion & Tenure Academic Affairs Faculty Affairs Annual Review, Promotion & Tenure Faculty Affairs Faculty Affairs Home Faculty Openings Hiring Policies & Guidelines New Faculty Information Faculty Evaluation & Review Faculty Resource Guide Faculty Affairs Forms Contact Faculty Affairs Academic Affairs Faculty Evaluation and Review Details about faculty performance evaluation are outlined in the KSU Faculty Handbook, Section 3 (Review and Evaluation of Faculty Performance). Faculty submit their annual and multi-year review portfolios electronically through\n                     Watermark. For more information on the faculty review process and Watermark, visit\n                     the Faculty Activity Data website . Post-Tenure Review for Administrative Faculty All tenured faculty who are defined as administrative faculty in Section 1.1 of Kennesaw State University’s Faculty Handbook are subject to the administrative post-tenure review process. Details about this process can be found in the KSU Faculty Handbook, Section 3.12.B.5 All other tenured instructional faculty are subject to the post-tenure review process\n                     described in Section 3.12.B.4 for tenure-track teaching faculty. Administrative Post-Tenure Review View Frequently Asked Questions for Post-Tenure Reviews View Administrative Review Survey Questions Review Tools Charge to P&T Review Committees Recommended Charge to Promotion and Tenure Committees Schedule of Review 2026 - 2027 Schedule of Reviews Guidance for Committees Guidance for the Chair of the Department P&T Committee (2026-2027) Guidance for the Chair of the College P&T Committee (2026-2027) Evaluation Forms and Templates Guidelines for Promotion and Tenure Approval Form for College Promotion and Tenure Guidelines Approval Form for Department Promotion and Tenure Guidelines Letter to External Reviewers Letter Template Promotion and Tenure Frequently Asked Questions When do I submit my tenure and/or promotion portfolio? Timelines can be found in the Schedule of Reviews linked under Review Tools. Who do I contact for assistance in preparing my tenure and/or promotion portfolio? Your academic home department chair is the best resource if you have questions or\n                                          require assistance in preparing your tenure and/or promotion portfolio. What materials must be included in my tenure and/or promotion portfolio? Please see KSU Faculty Handbook, Section 3.12.B.7 , Portfolio Guidelines and Contents. Can my tenure and/or promotion portfolio be submitted electronically? Faculty members must submit their portfolios electronically through Watermark . For questions about Watermark, please contact our Watermark team . Contact Information Kennesaw Campus 1000 Chastain Road Kennesaw, GA 30144 Marietta Campus 1100 South Marietta Pkwy Marietta, GA 30060 Phone 470-KSU-INFO (470-578-4636) Campus Maps Parking Media Resources Campus A-Z Index Academic Calendar Campus News D2L Brightspace University Information Technology Services Related Links Libraries Housing Financial Aid Degrees, Majors & Programs Registrar Job Opportunities Campus Security Global Education Sustainability Accessibility © 2026 Kennesaw State University. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Statement Accreditation Advisories Report a Concern Feedback Open Records Human Trafficking Notice Text Only ©"
