x KSU Home Career Planning and Development Careers Home Students Career Readiness Career Research Tools Internship and Co-op Support Events Department Policies Owl Trek Site Visits Presentation Requests Alumni Account Request Student Micro-Credentials Student FAQ Steppingblocks Big Resume Employers Home Post Jobs & Internships Attend Fairs & Events Host, Recruit & Hire on Campus Boost Your Visibility Frequently Asked Questions Contact Us Campus Partners Alumni Account Headshots for Faculty/Staff Faculty Career Champions Hiring Students and Interns Learning Environment and Effective Supervision Micro-Credentials Presentation Request Job Fairs Fall Career Fair Technology and Engineering Fair Government and Non-Profit Fair Healthcare Professions Fair Data & Outcomes Custom Data Request 2025-2026 Annual Report Career Fair Reports FAQs Contact Us Give to Career Planning and Development Students Employers Alumni Campus Partners Welcome Welcome to the Department of Career Planning and Development! It’s our mission to help KSU Owls thrive  — both in the classroom and in your chosen field. Our staff and faculty members are available to help answer any questions you may have and to help you get started on your career path. Through our many available resources and tools, you will have access to services, programs, and experiences to help you succeed. Find Your Path. Find Your Success. Have questions? We have answers. Contact us today at 470-KSU-INFO (470-578-4636). Career and Internship Resources Career Guidebook What Can I Do with My Major? Group Presentation Request College Specific Resources Activate or finish completing your Handshake Profile Get the Handshake App Apple App Store Google Play Career Development Events See all Events Partners-in-Success Learn more Diamond Mohawk Industries Norfolk Southern Northside Hospital Wellstar Health System Yamaha Motor Corporation Platinum Archer Western Batson-Cook Construction Cleveland Electric Elma Electronics Enterprise Georgia 