    "https://campus.kennesaw.edu/offices-services/careers/campus-community/": {
      "title": "Campus Community",
      "description": "Campus Community  - Careers Skip to main navigation Skip to main content Skip to footer KSU Home Current Students MyKSU Resources D2L Brightspace Owl Express KSUmail DegreeWorks KCash Owl Life Handshake Course Evaluations Campus Services Dining Parking & Transportation University Libraries Student Health Services Service Portal Student Employment Campus Directory Academic Resources Tutoring Resources Student Success Advising Student Handbook Bursar Financial Aid University Registrar Faculty & Staff MyKSU Resources D2L Brightspace Owl Express/Banner KSUmail KSU Connect VPN Academic Resources Academic Affairs Faculty Affairs Center for Excellence in Teaching and Learning Course Evaluations Open Education Resources Faculty Handbook Promotion & Tenure University Registrar Employee Resources Service Portal Human Resources Campus Services University Information Technology Services Campus Directory Payroll OneUSG Connect Colleges Colleges Coles College of Business Geer College of the Arts College of Architecture & Construction Management Bagwell College of Education College of Computing & Software Engineering Norman J. Radow College of Humanities & Social Sciences College of Science & Mathematics Graduate College KSU Journey Honors College Southern Polytechnic College of Engineering & Engineering Technology Wellstar College of Health & Human Services Offices & Services Offices & Services University Registrar Parking & Transportation Student Affairs Housing & Residence Life Event & Venue Management University Information Technology Services Fiscal Services University Libraries Academic Advising Campus Operations Strategic Communications & Marketing Policies & Governance Policy Resources University Handbooks Institutional Policies Complaints & Appeals Conflict of Interest General Data Protection Regulation Protecting Minors Public Forum FERPA Governance University Council Administrators Council Staff Senate Faculty Senate Student Government A-Z Index KSU Home Campus Community Careers Campus Community Campus Community Alumni Account Headshots for Faculty/Staff Faculty Career Champions Hiring Students and Interns Learning Environment and Effective Supervision Micro-Credentials Presentation Request Here at KSU, we consider everyone who has a direct impact on our students to be our\n                     partners in success. With that in mind, we do our best to work closely with not only\n                     KSU faculty, staff, and other campus partners, but also with the parents and family\n                     of every student in a host of capacities. We invite you to take some time to review the information on this page and contact\n                     us to learn about ways to partner with our office. Graduate insights via Steppingblocks Online Career Readiness Training Department Data Steppingblocks Kennesaw State University provides Steppingblocks as a resource to both students and faculty, through two separate forums. Faculty - Graduate Insights & Outcomes Explorer Faculty can pull up-to-date alumni data from current real-world sources, filterable\n                                             by degree, industry, and more, to understand your alumni population by geographic\n                                             and demographic factors, or even see top employers. Request a Graduate Insights Account Visit the Graduate Insights Portal Students - Digital Career Counselor Students have access to a 20-question personality assessment, a career path explorer, an institutional outcomes explorer, and a tuition analyzer. They can view assembled day-in-the-life content for any number of different careers, and plan for the educational pathway to reach their chosen field. Learn more about the Digital Career Counselor Online Learning for Career Growth and Development KSU’s MOOCs provide the foundation that learners need to explore career paths, develop their current careers, and ultimately succeed in future careers. Explore Free Online Courses Departmental Data & Reports To better assist your research, we've compiled our most requested resources and reports\n                                    on this page. Job Fair Attendance Internship & Co-op Participation First Destination Survey Results and more View Archive Contact Information Kennesaw Campus 1000 Chastain Road Kennesaw, GA 30144 Marietta Campus 1100 South Marietta Pkwy Marietta, GA 30060 Phone 470-KSU-INFO (470-578-4636) Campus Maps Parking Media Resources Campus A-Z Index Academic Calendar Campus News D2L Brightspace University Information Technology Services Related Links Libraries Housing Financial Aid Degrees, Majors & Programs Registrar Job Opportunities Campus Security Global Education Sustainability Accessibility © 2026 Kennesaw State University. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Statement Accreditation Advisories Report a Concern Feedback Open Records Human Trafficking Notice Text Only ©"
