ome Alumni Account Careers Campus Community Alumni Account Campus Community Alumni Account Headshots for Faculty/Staff Faculty Career Champions Hiring Students and Interns Learning Environment and Effective Supervision Micro-Credentials Presentation Request Alumni Account Request This form is for alumni to receive access to Handshake post-graduation. This form is not intended for current students, as access to Handshake will remain active while students are enrolled. All alumni Handshake accounts are now available by request.  Please complete the form below, make sure to include your preferred e-mail address (NOT your KSU student email). NOTE: This form cannot be used to reactivate or access your KSU student email account. NetIDs and KSU student email accounts are deactivated after 1 year.  View the Alumni Relations FAQ for more information. Handshake Need Help Logging in? Review this information from Handshake and click the button below to get started. Access Handshake Here If you see this don't fill out this input box. KSU ID Number * First Name * Last Name * Contact E-mail Address NOTE: Please use a non-KSU email address. * Major * Graduation Term (Spring, Fall, Summer) * Graduation Year Submit Cancel Contact Information Kennesaw Campus 1000 Chastain Road Kennesaw, GA 30144 Marietta Campus 1100 South Marietta Pkwy Marietta, GA 30060 Phone 470-KSU-INFO (470-578-4636) Campus Maps Parking Media Resources Campus A-Z Index Academic Calendar Campus News D2L Brightspace University Information Technology Services Related Links Libraries Housing Financial Aid Degrees, Majors & Programs Registrar Job Opportunities Campus Security Global Education Sustainability Accessibility © 2026 Kennesaw State University. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Statement Accreditation Advisories Report a Concern Feedback Open Records Human Trafficking Notice Text Only ©"
